OL,3,AMicrosoft profits surge days after
OL,4,Aannouncing major job cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FLike other tech firms, Microsoft is
OL,7,Finvesting heavily in the infrastructure
OL,8,Fthat powers AI even as questions remain
OL,9,Fover whether such huge spending will
OL,10,Fpay off.
OL,12,FMicrosoft shares rose by almost 2.9% in
OL,13,Fafter hours trading in New York on
OL,14,FWednesday.
